  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "arabella-fracture-fracture-amplication",
      "title": {
        "en": "Arabella, Fracture, Fracture Amplication"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Arabella's gimmick is the DoT Fracture\nFracture is 40% Dmg per stack, Max 30 = 1200% Max\nFracture whenever activated, gets cut in half and rounded down\nExample:\n30 -> 15 -> 7 -> 3 -> 1 -> 0\nFracture can be buffed by additive and multiplicative NONE CARD effects eg: Moral, Sever Ties, Observer's Pleasure\nFracture can also Crit\nFracture Amplification:\nFracture Amplification is very very important on Arabella\nIt changes Fracture Activate Math heavily\nWhen Fracture is Activated, after Activation Frac Amp will refund 1/2 Fracture\n1 generally, 2 if the enemy is solo\nExample Math: if enemy isnt alone\n4>2>3>1>2>1>2 etc\n4 Frac Activate, Total Frac = 11 = 440%\nIf Enemy is Alone\n4>2>4>2>4>2>4 etc\n4 Frac Activate, Total Frac = 16 = 640%\nWithout Fracture Activate\n4>2=2>1=1>0=0\n3 Frac Activate, Total Frac = 7 = 280%"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Fracture Amplification Example extended"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Example Math:\nIf enemy isnt solo\n30>15>16>8>9>4>5>2>3>1>2>1>2>1>2>1>2>1>2 etc\nTotal Activates 10, Fracture Stacks Total = 73 x 40% = 2920%\nIf enemy is solo\n30>15>17>8>10>5>7>3>5>2>4>2>4>2>4>2>4>2>4 etc\nTotal Activates 10, Fracture Stacks Total = 89 x 40% = 3560%"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
